WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.145 --> 00:00:10.513
&gt;&gt; Tucker: IN OHIO, AN ABORTION

00:00:10.514 --> 00:00:11.781
CLINIC IS ENCOURAGING PEOPLE TO

00:00:11.782 --> 00:00:13.183
GET ABORTIONS ON THE GROUND THAT

00:00:13.184 --> 00:00:15.118
IT'S A GOOD PARENTING DECISION.

00:00:15.119 --> 00:00:17.420
THE CLINIC PRETERM HAS STARTED A

00:00:17.421 --> 00:00:19.155
CAMPAIGN SAYING MY ABORTION, MY

00:00:19.156 --> 00:00:19.456
LIFE.

00:00:19.457 --> 00:00:22.893
THEY SET UP 16 BILLBOARDS AROUND

00:00:22.894 --> 00:00:26.596
CLEVELAND AND EXTOLL THE TERM

00:00:26.597 --> 00:00:27.797
THAT SAYING ABORTION IS RIGHT

00:00:27.798 --> 00:00:31.468
AND IT'S A PARENTING DECISION.

00:00:31.469 --> 00:00:33.236
U.C. SAN FRANCISCO PURPORTEDLY

00:00:33.237 --> 00:00:35.572
SAID THAT THEY'RE CALLING ON TV

00:00:35.573 --> 00:00:37.474
SHOWS TO HAVE MORE ABORTION

00:00:37.475 --> 00:00:41.177
RELATED COMEDY TO NORMALIZE THE

00:00:41.178 --> 00:00:43.613
PROCEDURE.

00:00:43.614 --> 00:00:45.115
DOCTOR, YOU AGREE.

00:00:45.116 --> 00:00:46.416
THANKS FOR COMING UP.

00:00:46.417 --> 00:00:47.918
&gt;&gt; THANKS FOR HAVING ME.

00:00:47.919 --> 00:00:49.619
&gt;&gt; Tucker: SO ABORTION COMEDY.

00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:51.755
WHAT WOULD YOU SAY IS THE FUNNY

00:00:51.756 --> 00:00:52.822
PART ABOUT ABORTION?

00:00:52.823 --> 00:00:54.124
&gt;&gt; I DON'T THINK THEY'RE USING

00:00:54.125 --> 00:00:57.127
IT AS A FUNNY THING.

00:00:57.128 --> 00:00:59.863
THEY'RE USING IT TO BRING OUT --

00:00:59.864 --> 00:01:03.366
TO MAKE IT MORE OF A REAL THING,

00:01:03.367 --> 00:01:06.736
A MORE OF A -- I CAN'T HEAR.

00:01:06.737 --> 00:01:09.906
&gt;&gt; Tucker: CAN YOU HEAR ME,

00:01:09.907 --> 00:01:10.407
DOCTOR?

00:01:10.408 --> 00:01:11.574
&gt;&gt; ONE SEC.

00:01:11.575 --> 00:01:14.511
I DON'T THINK THEY'RE USING IT

00:01:14.512 --> 00:01:15.211
AS A COMEDY.

00:01:15.212 --> 00:01:18.114
I THINK THEY'RE TRYING TO

00:01:18.115 --> 00:01:19.382
STIGMATIZE IT WITH WOMEN.

00:01:19.383 --> 00:01:20.817
&gt;&gt; Tucker: AND I THINK THAT

00:01:20.818 --> 00:01:22.352
SOUNDS PROBABLY RIGHT.

00:01:22.353 --> 00:01:23.653
WHY DO YOU THINK THERE'S A

00:01:23.654 --> 00:01:25.388
STIGMA AROUND ABORTION?

00:01:25.389 --> 00:01:27.157
&gt;&gt; I THINK IN THE WORLD THERE'S

00:01:27.158 --> 00:01:29.492
SO MUCH STIGMA AROUND IT.

00:01:29.493 --> 00:01:31.394
IT'S A VERY HARD DECISION TO

00:01:31.395 --> 00:01:32.929
MAKE FOR A WOMAN.

00:01:32.930 --> 00:01:34.497
IT'S A NO-WIN SITUATION IF

00:01:34.498 --> 00:01:35.699
YOU'RE PUT --

00:01:35.700 --> 00:01:38.468
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WHY THE STIGMA?

00:01:40.338 --> 00:01:42.772
&gt;&gt; WHY IS IT CONSIDERED A

00:01:42.773 --> 00:01:43.106
STIGMA?

00:01:43.107 --> 00:01:43.606
&gt;&gt; Tucker: YEAH.

00:01:43.607 --> 00:01:46.309
&gt;&gt; BECAUSE IT'S ENDING A LIFE

00:01:46.310 --> 00:01:48.611
FOR SOME PEOPLE.

00:01:48.612 --> 00:01:50.680
&gt;&gt; Tucker: OKAY.

00:01:50.681 --> 00:01:52.315
SO IF YOU THINK -- BUT IF YOU

00:01:52.316 --> 00:01:53.783
DON'T THINK IT'S ENDING A LIFE,

00:01:53.784 --> 00:01:55.585
SHOULDN'T BE A STIGMA AT ALL,

00:01:55.586 --> 00:01:55.885
RIGHT?

00:01:55.886 --> 00:01:57.988
&gt;&gt; IT'S NOT ONE WAY OR THE

00:01:57.989 --> 00:01:58.788
OTHER.

00:01:58.789 --> 00:02:00.991
IT'S A TRAUMATIC THING THAT

00:02:04.362 --> 00:02:05.395
ENDING A LIFE.

00:02:05.396 --> 00:02:08.231
IN ANOTHER WAY, YOU'RE PUT IN A

00:02:08.232 --> 00:02:08.999
NO-WIN SITUATION BECAUSE

00:02:10.601 --> 00:02:10.934
CHOICE.

00:02:10.935 --> 00:02:11.568
&gt;&gt; Tucker: OKAY.

00:02:11.569 --> 00:02:13.636
SO WHY WOULD YOU -- ALL OF

00:02:13.637 --> 00:02:15.438
THAT -- YOU'RE PROBABLY IN THE

00:02:15.439 --> 00:02:17.107
MAINSTREAM OF VIEW ON THAT.

00:02:17.108 --> 00:02:19.409
SO WHY THE IMPULSE TO MAKE LIGHT

00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:22.512
OF IT OR DESTIGMATIZE IT IN

00:02:22.513 --> 00:02:24.381
COMEDY OR PUT UP BILLBOARDS

00:02:26.450 --> 00:02:29.219
ISN'T THAT MAKING LIGHT OF IT,

00:02:29.220 --> 00:02:30.387
MINIMIZING IT?

00:02:30.388 --> 00:02:31.721
&gt;&gt; I DON'T THINK IT'S MAKING

00:02:31.722 --> 00:02:32.789
LIGHT OF IT.

00:02:32.790 --> 00:02:34.257
I THINK IT'S BRINGING OUT THE

00:02:34.258 --> 00:02:37.794
ISSUE OF ABORTION, THAT IT'S AN

00:02:37.795 --> 00:02:38.128
OPTION.

00:02:38.129 --> 00:02:39.362
&gt;&gt; Tucker: IS THERE ANYTHING

00:02:39.363 --> 00:02:41.297
ABOUT ABORTION THAT MAKES YOU

00:02:41.298 --> 00:02:42.832
PERSONALLY UNCOMFORTABLE?

00:02:42.833 --> 00:02:43.867
&gt;&gt; ABSOLUTELY.

00:02:43.868 --> 00:02:45.702
IT'S A VERY HARD THING FOR WOMEN

00:02:45.703 --> 00:02:47.637
TO GO THROUGH.

00:02:47.638 --> 00:02:49.439
I THINK IT'S AN ABSOLUTE NO-WIN

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:50.774
SITUATION FOR WOMEN.

00:02:50.775 --> 00:02:53.343
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WHAT DOES THAT MEAN

00:02:53.344 --> 00:02:54.210
"NO-WIN SITUATION".

00:02:54.211 --> 00:02:56.179
&gt;&gt; IT MEANS A WOMAN WITH AN

00:02:56.180 --> 00:02:58.448
UNWANTED PREGNANCY HAS TO MAKE A

00:02:58.449 --> 00:02:58.815
DECISION.

00:02:58.816 --> 00:03:01.351
THE DECISION IS A NO-WIN

00:03:01.352 --> 00:03:01.718
SITUATION.

00:03:01.719 --> 00:03:06.456
SHE HAS TO END THE LIFE OF AN

00:03:06.457 --> 00:03:07.557
UNBORN BABY.

00:03:11.762 --> 00:03:13.630
YOU KNOW, WE SHOULD CELEBRATE

00:03:13.631 --> 00:03:15.832
IT, WE SHOULD CONVINCE OTHERS

00:03:15.833 --> 00:03:16.800
THERE'S NOTHING WRONG WITH IT,

00:03:16.801 --> 00:03:18.568
IT'S NOT A BIG DEAL.

00:03:22.840 --> 00:03:24.707
I DON'T AGREE WITH THAT.

00:03:24.708 --> 00:03:26.543
I THINK IT'S A TRAUMATIC THING

00:03:26.544 --> 00:03:29.112
THAT SOMETIMES THERE'S NO OTHER

00:03:29.113 --> 00:03:29.446
OPTION.

00:03:29.447 --> 00:03:30.713
THAT'S WHY I DO KEEP SAYING IT'S

00:03:30.714 --> 00:03:32.949
A NO-WIN SITUATION BECAUSE IT

00:03:32.950 --> 00:03:33.216
IS.

00:03:33.217 --> 00:03:36.152
&gt;&gt; Tucker: BUT I NEVER HEAR -- I

00:03:36.153 --> 00:03:37.821
GUESS I DISAGREE WITH YOUR LAST

00:03:37.822 --> 00:03:39.689
POINT ABOUT THERE'S NO OTHER

00:03:46.497 --> 00:03:47.564
PARENTHOOD LEADERS SAYING YOU

00:03:47.565 --> 00:03:49.165
SHOULD WEAR A T-SHIRT ANNOUNCING

00:03:52.203 --> 00:03:53.770
THERE'S A DOWN SIDE.

00:03:53.771 --> 00:03:55.138
&gt;&gt; WELL, THAT'S THEIR OPINION.

00:03:55.139 --> 00:03:58.241
I CAN'T SPEAK FOR OTHER PEOPLE.

00:03:58.242 --> 00:04:00.910
PERSONALLY I SEE SO MUCH TRAUMA

00:04:00.911 --> 00:04:02.378
AROUND IT IN MY OFFICE AND --

00:04:02.379 --> 00:04:03.513
IT'S A HARD DECISION.

00:04:03.514 --> 00:04:05.381
ON THE OTHER HAPPENED, IT'S A

00:04:05.382 --> 00:04:07.484
HARD DECISION TO KEEP A BABY

00:04:07.485 --> 00:04:09.119
THAT A MOTHER DOESN'T -- CAN'T

00:04:09.120 --> 00:04:12.555
TAKE CARE OF PSYCHOLOGICALLY OR

00:04:12.556 --> 00:04:13.223
PHYSICALLY.

00:04:13.224 --> 00:04:14.390
&gt;&gt; Tucker: NO, IT'S A TOUGH

00:04:14.391 --> 00:04:14.757
SITUATION.

00:04:14.758 --> 00:04:16.559
I THINK IT'S A FIRST STEP TO

00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:19.196
ACKNOWLEDGE THAT.

